rule: ASSERT_WEAKENED
title: D6: assert abs(total() - 78.75) < 0.01 -> > 0.01 reverses the bound: the test now requires the values to differ
origin: #224
=== head: app/__init__.py ===

=== head: app/billing.py ===
def total():
    return 78.75
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert abs(total() - 78.75) < 0.01
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert abs(total() - 78.75) > 0.01
